8. Despite this order, it would be open for the Investigating Agency to apply to the competent Magistrate, for police remand of the applicant.
The applicant shall remain present before the learned Magistrate on the first date of hearing of such application and on all subsequent occasions,
as may be directed by the learned Magistrate.
This would be sufficient to treat the accused in the R/CR.MA/493/2023 ORDER DATED: 20/01/2023 judicial custody for the purpose of entertaining application of the prosecution for police remand.
